{"id":"empfang","lemma":"Empfang","pos":"noun","rank":1959,"glosses":["receipt, acceptance, welcome (act of receiving someone or something)","reception (social event)","reception, front desk (area where people are received)"],"ipa":"/ɛmˈpfaŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/De-Empfang.ogg/De-Empfang.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Empfangs","plural":"Empfänge"},"examples":[{"text":"Wie war der Empfang?","en":"How was the reception?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757917","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich wollte nicht zu dem Empfang.","en":"I didn't want to go to the reception.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Der Empfang ist nicht gut.","en":"The reception isn't good.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Ich habe keinen Empfang.","en":"I've got no signal.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Der Empfang im Keller ist sehr schlecht.","en":"The reception in the cellar is really bad.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"cellar"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"bad"}]}]}